# Cloudflare static-asset redirects.
#
# IMPORTANT: Host-level (www → non-www), protocol-level (http → https),
# trailing-slash normalization AND root → /km/ language dispatch are all
# handled in src/middleware.ts in ONE redirect hop. Keep this file minimal
# so it does not fight the middleware and create redirect loops.
#
# Only legacy /en /zh /km → trailing-slash variants live here as an extra
# safety net; middleware already adds the slash anyway.

/en  /en/  301
/zh  /zh/  301
/km  /km/  301

/en/privacy-policy  /en/privacy-policy/  301
/zh/privacy-policy  /zh/privacy-policy/  301
/km/privacy-policy  /km/privacy-policy/  301

/en/terms-of-service  /en/terms-of-service/  301
/zh/terms-of-service  /zh/terms-of-service/  301
/km/terms-of-service  /km/terms-of-service/  301

/en/cookie-settings  /en/cookie-settings/  301
/zh/cookie-settings  /zh/cookie-settings/  301
/km/cookie-settings  /km/cookie-settings/  301
